10
01:06:52,500 --> 01:06:58,500
It was produced by The Daily Wire and Bonfire Legend, and
distributed by The Daily Wire and Voltage Pictures.

11
01:13:33,750 --> 01:13:39,750
The film follows a family of pioneers as they defend themselves
from a gang of outlaws on the Montana plains.

12
01:20:15,000 --> 01:20:21,000
The film features the cast of Gina Carano as Hattie McAllister, Donald Cerrone as Jeb McAllister, and Nick Searcy starring as The Captain, with Rhys
Jackson Becker, Gabriel-Kane Day Lewis, Tyler Fischer, Heath Freeman, Samaire Armstrong, and Matthias Hues all featured in supporting roles.

13
01:26:56,250 --> 01:27:02,250
